Accept: application/json

###
### List incidents (Phase 4B)
GET {{SmartCity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents
Accept: application/json

###
### Create incident (Phase 4B)
POST {{SmartCity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

